        "id": 57185,
        "name": "Ameena",
        "username": "Ameena",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ameena/{size}/1907_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-04-01T17:07:47.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I'd say that a damaging pin on someone like the Adept, if he's the only one who can destroy said pin, could be pretty nasty - he has only two ways of dealing damage (Scherzo of Frost and Flame, and the Accompany text on erm...Syncopated Onslaught I think?) so therefore a very limited number of cards which he could call upon to destroy the pin. Meanwhile it's whittling him down bit by bit, him being the hero with the lowest starting hp out of everyone. Plus if he's using his turns to deal damage, that's one action used which could otherwise be buffing/helping another hero or whatever.</p>",
        "post_number": 21,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T02:32:26.788Z",
