        "id": 57186,
        "name": "Spiff",
        "username": "Spiff",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/spiff/{size}/1865_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-04-01T18:30:50.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>/agree with Ameena.&nbsp; It's true that a low-damage hero won't likely be damaging the villain on their turn anyway, but if their team mates can't attack the pin, then that pin is never going to go away.&nbsp; And in a coop game, I'd rather Ra could come to Adept's aid when he needs it than for Adept to just spend the entire game pinned to the ground.</p>",
