        "name": "Ronway",
        "username": "Ronway",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ronway/{size}/1856_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-04-01T19:40:09.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I can say that the first batch of playtesting the pins in fact only had 5 HP, so the health of them wouldn't be too bad for low damaging heroes and would be easy work for high damaging ones. Granted who knows how many changes were made between Launius' and the first to the playtesters on the forums.</p>",
